  (text "AUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. The circuit is ADOPTED (2026-09-30): the in-amp's output comes in on\nBREATH_INAMP_OUT and the shaped, restored signal leaves on BREATH_SHAPED for POT-GAIN (module/breath-output-stage).\n\n[U-RESP] One OPA2197: half A shapes at -1/2, half B restores at -2.\n\n[V_IN_HALF] V_in/2, the pot's fixed end. The divider is what makes the null exact.\n\n[V_SHAPED] The pot's other end and the restoring half's input." (at 40.64 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a7dabe0e-0438-5047-94cf-4f03519d8b9b))
  (text "THIS CIRCUIT IS ON BOTH MODULE BOARDS (ADR 0023). Page main holds its main-board parts, page jack the parts behind the panel; the labels here join the two pages, and on the boards J-B2B-MOD joins them. Each board places its own page." (at 60.96 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 15f4a5e1-ec8b-5bec-aa90-2b9ced940467))
